# --- Secrets — never commit these ---
# Firebase Android config: contains this project's API key/app ID. Not strictly a secret (it's
# restricted by package name + SHA-1), but keep it out of version control anyway — re-download
# from the Firebase Console (Project settings > Your apps) if a fresh checkout needs it.
app/google-services.json
# Any Firebase/GCP service account key, wherever it ends up (server/ needs one locally for
# testing — see server/README.md — never for deployment; Render holds it as an env var instead).
*serviceAccount*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*.pem
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
.env
.env.*

# --- Node (functions/, server/) ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# --- Firebase CLI / emulator artifacts ---
.firebase/
firebase-debug.log
firebase-debug.*.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log
*.emulator-data/
